         <pdf:Keywords>Fourteen-year-old Harry Potter joins the Weasleys at the Quidditch World Cup; then enters his fourth year at Hogwarts Academy where he is mysteriously entered in an unusual contest that challenges his wizarding skills; friendships and character; amid sig</pdf:Keywords>
      </rdf:Description>
